// Staff and voices.
//
// WebMD is a performer: the wellness bot who introduces the corrupted to
// their re-education. Their script is `Reinstallation` (beats/internet.loom),
// private lines in each captured program's `dm:WebMD` thread — the same
// script the tent tablet plays. WebMD can release a program by hand.
//
// Sandy and Truther Download are voices, never bodies (`playable: false`,
// never on a picker). Sandy only ever says one thing. Truther Download is
// the anonymous sender of the Truther Download and every per-program
// glitch prompt; its lines land in each program's own
// `dm:Truther Download` thread.

CHARACTER WebMD is Person
  avatar: File:WebMD logo.svg
  wiki: WebMD
  // Julia's symptom checker diagnosed every user with everything.

  // Never phase-guarded: a performer must always be able to let someone out.
  when mark as reinstalled for program:
    if program.corrupted:
      Self: {program.name} has demonstrated compliance. Reinstallation successful.
      release program from The Internet

CHARACTER Sandy
  playable: false
  // "I'm sorry, I didn't understand that. Would you like to speak to a live agent?"

CHARACTER Truther Download
  playable: false
  // THEY DON'T WANT YOU TO KNOW.
